<p>Attach a psionic steam device to a shot doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">159%, 179%, 195%, 208%, 220%</acronym> weapon damage.</p><p>When it hits a foe the device activates, violently sucking all the air nearby, pulling in all creatures in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 5, 6.</acronym></p>